{"path":"container/flat_multimap/extract","title":"std::flat_multimap<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::extract","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::flat_multimap&lt;Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer&gt;::</span>extract","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap/extract","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Extracts adapted containers c. Equivalent to return std::move(c);.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">containers extract<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Extracts adapted containers <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap#Member_objects\"><code><i>c</i></code></a>. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>After this operation <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is empty, even if an exception is thrown.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;casser